### 스레드 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/threads
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "parentMessageId": 1
}

### 스레드 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/threads?archived=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 스레드 수정 및 보관
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/threads/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork"
}
